/* Malazgirt Akıncıları: English content (araclar/en/derle.js üretir) */
window.ICERIK_EN = {"seferler":[["Manzikert","Sultan Alp Arslan's campaign","MANZIKERT!","26 August 1071. The Byzantine army broke and Emperor Romanos Diogenes was captured. Sultan Alp Arslan pardoned him and set him free. The gates of Anatolia were open."],["Raid into Anatolia","West with Süleyman Shah","NICAEA!","1075. Süleyman Shah entered Nicaea and made it the first capital of the Seljuks of Anatolia. The raiders reached the shores of the Marmara."],["Against the Crusaders","Sultan Kılıç Arslan's defence","HERACLEA!","1101. Three great Crusader armies broke on the Anatolian steppe. Kılıç Arslan moved his capital to Konya; the Turkmens took root in Anatolia."],["Myriokephalon","Kılıç Arslan II's victory","MYRIOKEPHALON!","17 September 1176. The Byzantine army broke in the mountain pass. Emperor Manuel sued for peace. Anatolia is now a Turkish home."],["Seljuk Zenith","A sultanate on two seas","SUDAK!","1225. After Antalya, Sinop and Alanya, Seljuk raiders crossed the Black Sea into Crimea. Caravanserais guard the roads, dockyards the seas."],["Frontier Beyliks","A beylik born at Söğüt","BAPHEUS!","27 July 1302. Osman Gazi routed the Byzantine army at Bapheus. The small frontier beylik is opening the door to a state."],["Into Rumelia","Orhan Gazi and Süleyman Pasha","ADRIANOPLE!","Bursa became the capital and the raiders crossed the Dardanelles on rafts. Adrianople was taken; the door to Rumelia flung wide open."],["Kosovo","Sultan Murad I's campaign","KOSOVO!","15 June 1389. The Balkan alliance broke on the Field of Kosovo. Sultan Murad fell a martyr; Bayezid the Thunderbolt took command of the army."],["Nicopolis","Bayezid the Thunderbolt's campaign","NICOPOLIS!","25 September 1396. Europe's largest Crusader army broke on the banks of the Danube. Bayezid's name rang across Europe."],["Varna","Sultan Murad II's campaign","VARNA!","10 November 1444. The last great Crusader army broke at Varna. The road through the Balkans lay open; Constantinople was next."],["Conquest of Constantinople","Sultan Mehmed II's campaign","CONQUEST!","29 May 1453. Through the breach in the walls the army entered the city. Sultan Mehmed II was now the Conqueror; Istanbul became the new capital. An age ended and a new one began."],["Campaigns of the Conqueror","From the Morea to Trebizond, Bosnia to Otranto","OTRANTO!","1480. Gedik Ahmed Pasha landed at Otranto on the Italian coast. After Smederevo, the Morea, Trebizond, Bosnia and Negroponte, the Conqueror's banner flies on the shores of two seas."],["Belgrade and Rhodes","Sultan Süleyman's first campaigns","RHODES!","December 1522. After a six-month siege the Knights of Rhodes left the island. With Belgrade and Rhodes, the gates of the Danube and the Aegean opened."],["Mohács","The Magnificent's Hungarian campaign","MOHÁCS!","29 August 1526. On the plain of Mohács the Hungarian army broke within two hours. The king died in the marsh as he fled; the gates of Buda opened."],["Buda","Fifteen years on the Danube","BUDA!","29 August 1541. Exactly fifteen years after Mohács, Sultan Süleyman entered Buda. Buda is now the seat of a province; Turkish banners line the Danube."],["Szigetvár","The Magnificent's last campaign","SZIGETVÁR!","7 September 1566. Szigetvár fell. Sultan Süleyman died in his camp on the last night of the siege without seeing the victory; his death was hidden from the army for days."],["Cyprus","Lala Mustafa Pasha's campaign","FAMAGUSTA!","1 August 1571. After a siege of many months Famagusta surrendered. The island of Cyprus is now an Ottoman province."],["Mezőkeresztes","Sultan Mehmed III's campaign","MEZŐKERESZTES!","26 October 1596. The Habsburg army broke in the marsh of Mezőkeresztes. This field victory, won after Eger, restored the balance on the Danube."],["Crete","The long siege of Candia","CANDIA!","6 September 1669. After a siege of twenty-four years Candia surrendered. The island of Crete joined the Ottoman lands."],["Uyvar and Kamaniçe","The age of the Köprülüs","KAMANIÇE!","27 August 1672. The castle of Kamaniçe on its rocky headland surrendered. After Uyvar, the Polish campaign also ended in victory; the empire reached its widest borders."],["Prut","Baltacı Mehmed Pasha's campaign","PRUT!","22 July 1711. Trapped on the banks of the Prut, the Russian army was forced to sue for peace. Azov was retaken."],["Return to Manzikert","The plain where it all began","MANZIKERT!","The road that began on 26 August 1071 with a handful of raiders ended, 1071 levels later, on the plain of Manzikert once more. The banner carried for centuries is now in your hands, Raider Bey."],["The Morea","Damat Ali Pasha's campaign","THE MOREA!","1715. Within a hundred days every castle of the Morea was retaken. Venice withdrew from the peninsula."],["Belgrade","Grocka and Belgrade","BELGRADE!","18 September 1739. After the victory at Grocka, besieged Belgrade returned to Ottoman lands with the Treaty of Belgrade."],["Caransebeș","Koca Yusuf Pasha's campaign","CARANSEBEȘ!","September 1788. At Caransebeș the Habsburg army, seized by panic in the night, scattered itself. The Ottoman army entered the Banat."],["Acre","Cezzar Ahmed Pasha's defence","ACRE!","20 May 1799. After a sixty-two-day siege Napoleon was forced to withdraw from Acre. His eastern campaign ended at the walls of Acre."],["Silistra","The Crimean War on the Danube","SILISTRA!","June 1854. After a forty-day siege the Russian army withdrew from Silistra. The defence of Arab Tabia became a legend."],["Plevna","Gazi Osman Pasha's defence","PLEVNA!","11 September 1877. The third great assault also broke before the redoubts. Gazi Osman Pasha's months-long defence became a legend around the world."],["Domokos","Edhem Pasha's campaign","DOMOKOS!","17 May 1897. The victory on the ridges of Domokos opened the road through Thessaly; the Thirty Days' War ended in an Ottoman victory."],["Road to Conquest","To level one thousand four hundred and fifty-three","CONQUEST!","An age had passed through the breach opened on 29 May 1453. 1453 levels later the banner stands on the walls of Istanbul again. The city is yours, Raider Bey."]],"soon":["New Campaigns","Coming soon"],"bosses":{"kumandan":"Vanguard Commander","duka":"Duke of Edessa","strategos":"Strategos","katafraktbasi":"Cataphract Chief","varangbasi":"Varangian Captain","imparator":"Imperial Guard","akritbeyi":"Akritai Lord","sinirdukasi":"Frontier Duke","iznikdukasi":"Duke of Nicaea","sovalyebasi":"Knight Captain","frankkontu":"Frankish Count","normandukasi":"Norman Duke","haclibasi":"Crusader Commander","kalkanbasi":"Shield Captain","mancinikustasi":"Catapult Master","manuel":"The Emperor's Banner","latinkomutani":"Latin Commander","trabzondukasi":"Duke of Trebizond","rusknezi":"Rus Prince","cenevizkaptani":"Genoese Captain","tekfur":"Fort Lord","alanbeyi":"Alan Chief","bizansbaskomutani":"Byzantine Commander-in-Chief","katalanbasi":"Catalan Captain","edirnekomutani":"Commander of Adrianople","sirpvoyvoda":"Serbian Voivode","bulgarboyari":"Bulgarian Boyar","agirsuvaribasi":"Heavy Cavalry Captain","sirpkralsancagi":"The Serbian King's Banner","eflakbeyi":"Prince of Wallachia","macarbaronu":"Hungarian Baron","fransizkontu":"French Count","haclikral":"Crusader King","erdelvoyvoda":"Voivode of Transylvania","lehsovalye":"Polish Knight","venedikkaptani":"Venetian Captain","tabyakomutani":"Wagon Fort Commander","surkomutani":"Wall Commander","cenevizkomutani":"Genoese Commander","sonsancak":"Banner of the Last Emperor","moradespotu":"Despot of the Morea","venedikkomutani":"Venetian Commander","trabzonmuhafizi":"Guard of Trebizond","bosnakrali":"King of Bosnia","otrantokomutani":"Commander of Otranto","hirvatbani":"Ban of Croatia","belgradkomutani":"Commander of Belgrade","zirhlibasi":"Armoured Cavalry Captain","rodoskulesi":"Bastion Guard","rodosustadi":"Grand Master of the Knights","husarbasi":"Light Cavalry Captain","landsknechtbasi":"Mercenary Captain","topcubasi":"Master Gunner","macarkral":"The Hungarian King's Banner","avusturyakomutani":"Austrian Commander","budinkomutani":"Castellan of Buda","zigetvarkomutani":"Castellan of Szigetvár","kirasiyerbasi":"Cuirassier Captain","muskecibasi":"Musketeer Captain","avusturyakomutani2":"Austrian Commander","stradiotbasi":"Stradiot Captain","magusakomutani":"Commander of Famagusta","erdelprensi":"Prince of Transylvania","habsburgkomutani":"Habsburg Commander-in-Chief","fransizgeneral":"French Commander","kandiyekomutani":"Commander of Candia","uyvarkomutani":"Commander of Uyvar","kazakatamani":"Cossack Ataman","lehhatmani":"Polish Hetman","kamanicekomutani":"Commander of Kamaniçe","ruskomutani":"Russian General","carmuhafizi":"Tsar's Guard","malazgirtfinal":"Byzantine Imperial Army","proveditor":"Venetian Provveditore","avusturyamaresal":"Austrian Field Marshal","belgradmuhafizi":"Guard of Belgrade Castle","habsburgsancagi":"The Habsburg Emperor's Banner","fransizsuvaribasi":"French Cavalry Captain","fransizgeneral2":"French General","fransizmuhafiz":"French Guard Regiment","nisancibasi":"Sharpshooter Captain","rusmaresal":"Russian Field Marshal","grandukmuhafizi":"The Grand Duke's Guard","yunankomutani":"Greek Commander","yunanbaskomutani":"Greek Commander-in-Chief","fetihfinal":"The Last Emperor's Army"},"bossTxt":{"kumandan":"The Vanguard Commander waits at the end of the level. A giant; melt him with a rain of arrows.","duka":"The Duke of Edessa has blocked the road with his own regiment. You'll need to come out of the gates big.","strategos":"The Byzantine strategos leads his army. Don't close in before strengthening your bow.","katafraktbasi":"The Cataphract Chief comes on his iron-clad horse. The Fire Arrow will help a lot if you find it.","varangbasi":"The Varangian Captain, the emperor's axe-bearing guard. Bring down half of them before the clash.","imparator":"Emperor Romanos Diogenes's Guard Regiment stands before you. This is the final move, Raider Bey.","akritbeyi":"The Akritai Lord holds the road with his frontier riders. He comes fast; let him melt before your arrows.","sinirdukasi":"The Frontier Duke has left his castle. You can't reach him without scattering his regiment.","iznikdukasi":"The Duke of Nicaea makes his last stand before the walls. The gates of the city are behind him.","sovalyebasi":"The Knight Captain charges on his iron-clad horse. Ready your strongest bow.","frankkontu":"The Frankish Count has lined up his infantry. Melt the crowd first.","normandukasi":"The Norman Duke is the toughest Crusader commander. Keep the arrows flying.","haclibasi":"The commander of the Crusader army stands before you with his banner. The final move of this campaign.","kalkanbasi":"The Shield Captain leads the heavy infantry. You need a strong bow to pierce the shields.","mancinikustasi":"The Catapult Master rains stones. Dodge the shadows and rain arrows on the master.","manuel":"Emperor Manuel's banner and guards stand before you. The final move at Myriokephalon.","latinkomutani":"The Latin Commander leads his mercenaries. Melt the crowd, then reach him.","trabzondukasi":"The Duke of Trebizond won't give up Sinop. Scatter his guards.","rusknezi":"The Rus Prince has landed on the shore with his riders. He comes fast; meet him with arrows.","cenevizkaptani":"The Genoese Captain holds the tower with his crossbowmen. Melt them before entering their range.","tekfur":"The Fort Lord stands before the gates. Scatter his soldiers and the fort is yours.","alanbeyi":"The Alan Chief leads his mercenary horsemen. He comes fast and hard.","bizansbaskomutani":"The Byzantine Commander-in-Chief is at the centre of his army. The final move at Bapheus.","katalanbasi":"The Catalan Captain, the toughest of the emperor's mercenaries. Keep the arrows flying.","edirnekomutani":"The Commander of Adrianople makes his last stand before the walls. The heart of Rumelia lies behind him.","sirpvoyvoda":"The Serbian Voivode comes with his heavy cavalry. Ready your strongest bow.","bulgarboyari":"The Bulgarian Boyar stands before his castle. Melt his infantry and the gate opens.","agirsuvaribasi":"The Heavy Cavalry Captain charges. Thin their numbers before they close in.","sirpkralsancagi":"The Serbian King's banner and guards stand before you. The final move at Kosovo.","eflakbeyi":"The Prince of Wallachia rides out of the forest with his horsemen. Meet him early with arrows.","macarbaronu":"The Hungarian Baron leads his cavalry. He comes fast and hits hard.","fransizkontu":"The French Count has lined up his knights. Proud and impatient; meet them with arrows.","haclikral":"The Crusader King stands before you with his banner. The final move of this campaign.","erdelvoyvoda":"The Voivode of Transylvania forces the pass with his horsemen. Hold the defile.","lehsovalye":"The Polish Knight guards the king. His armour is heavy; your arrows must be strong.","venedikkaptani":"The Venetian Captain holds the shore with his crossbowmen. Melt them before entering their range.","tabyakomutani":"The Wagon Fort Commander lines up his handgunners behind the wagons. Break the fort or go around.","surkomutani":"The Wall Commander holds the breach. Melt them before they step out from behind the shields.","cenevizkomutani":"The Genoese Commander defends the weakest point of the walls. His armour is heavy; keep the arrows flying.","sonsancak":"The last emperor's banner and guards stand before you. The final move of the conquest.","moradespotu":"The Despot of the Morea stands before his castle with his guards. Scatter his soldiers.","venedikkomutani":"The Venetian Commander won't give up his coastal castle. Melt the crowd.","trabzonmuhafizi":"The guard regiment of Trebizond makes its last stand before the walls.","bosnakrali":"The King of Bosnia came down from his mountain castle with his heavy cavalry. Ready your strongest bow.","otrantokomutani":"The Commander of Otranto is at the head of the bastion. The final move of this campaign.","hirvatbani":"The Ban of Croatia leads his frontier soldiers. Melt the crowd first.","belgradkomutani":"The Commander of Belgrade makes his last stand in the inner castle. The gate is behind him.","zirhlibasi":"The Armoured Cavalry Captain charges on his iron-clad horse. Thin their numbers before they close in.","rodoskulesi":"The Bastion Guard stands on the wall with his knights. Their armour is thick; be patient.","rodosustadi":"The Grand Master of the Knights holds the last bastion. The final move at Rhodes.","husarbasi":"The Light Cavalry Captain comes like the wind. Meet him early with arrows.","landsknechtbasi":"The Mercenary Captain lines up his long-pikemen. Keep the arrows flying.","topcubasi":"The Master Gunner commands the cannons and arquebusiers. Melt them before entering their range.","macarkral":"The Hungarian King's banner and guards stand before you. The final move at Mohács.","avusturyakomutani":"The Austrian Commander faces you with his armoured cavalry. Ready your strongest bow.","budinkomutani":"The Castellan of Buda holds the last bastion. The final move at Buda.","zigetvarkomutani":"The commander of Szigetvár makes his last sortie with his guards. The final move at Szigetvár.","kirasiyerbasi":"The Cuirassier Captain comes with his fully armoured cavalry. Ready your strongest bow.","muskecibasi":"The Musketeer Captain has lined up his musketeers. Melt them before entering their range.","avusturyakomutani2":"The Austrian Commander leads his cuirassiers.","stradiotbasi":"The Stradiot Captain comes like the wind with his light horsemen. Meet him early with arrows.","magusakomutani":"The Commander of Famagusta holds the last bastion. The final move in Cyprus.","erdelprensi":"The Prince of Transylvania leads his horsemen. He comes fast; meet him with arrows.","habsburgkomutani":"The Habsburg Commander-in-Chief stands at the centre with his cuirassiers. The final move at Mezőkeresztes.","fransizgeneral":"The French Commander leads the landing troops. Melt the crowd.","kandiyekomutani":"The Commander of Candia holds the last bastion. The final move on Crete.","uyvarkomutani":"The Commander of Uyvar stands at his castle gate. Scatter his soldiers.","kazakatamani":"The Cossack Ataman rides out of the steppe with his horsemen. He comes fast.","lehhatmani":"The Polish Hetman leads his winged hussars. Heavy and fast; ready your strongest bow.","kamanicekomutani":"The Commander of Kamaniçe holds the last gate. The final move of the Polish campaign.","ruskomutani":"The Russian General has lined up his infantry. Melt the crowd first.","carmuhafizi":"The Tsar's Guard faces you with his grenadiers. The final move at the Prut.","malazgirtfinal":"The Byzantine Imperial Army stands before you in all its glory. The final move of a thousand and seventy-one levels, Raider Bey.","proveditor":"The Venetian Provveditore stands on his castle bastion. Scatter his soldiers.","avusturyamaresal":"The Austrian Field Marshal has lined up his white-coated infantry. Melt the crowd.","belgradmuhafizi":"The Guard of Belgrade Castle holds the last bastion. The final move of the Belgrade campaign.","habsburgsancagi":"The Habsburg Emperor's banner is in the middle of the rearguard. The final move at Caransebeș.","fransizsuvaribasi":"The French Cavalry Captain comes with his dragoons. Heavy and fast; meet them early with arrows.","fransizgeneral2":"The French General has put his infantry in attack formation. Keep the arrows flying.","fransizmuhafiz":"The French Guard Regiment throws itself at the breach. The final move at Acre.","nisancibasi":"The Sharpshooter Captain has lined up his riflemen in the trenches. Melt them before entering their range.","rusmaresal":"The Russian Field Marshal faces you with his grenadiers. Ready your strongest bow.","grandukmuhafizi":"The Grand Duke's Guard holds the last line. The final move at Plevna.","yunankomutani":"The Greek Commander has lined up his infantry on the ridges. Melt the crowd first.","yunanbaskomutani":"The Greek Commander-in-Chief holds the last position. The final move at Domokos.","fetihfinal":"The last emperor's army stands before the walls. The final move of a thousand four hundred and fifty-three levels, Raider Bey."},"unlock":{"2":"Shoot the number on a pedestal down to zero: a new bow, a horsetail standard or a Golden Alp becomes yours.","5":"Golden Alp pedestals have appeared. Alps march at the front of the army; each shoots with the power of twenty raiders.","8":"Spiked barricades from here on. Crash into one and you lose raiders; break it with arrows or go around.","11":"Byzantine archers take the field for the first time. They don't move and shoot once you're in range. Strike first.","14":"At some gates both sides are bad. Pick the less harmful one.","19":"The cataphracts are here: heavily armoured, fast cavalry. Meet them early with arrows.","31":"The Varangian Guard takes the field: the emperor's elite axemen.","50":"New campaign: Raid into Anatolia! Akritai horsemen take the field: Byzantium's fast frontier riders. 5 new levels unlocked in the Camp; the Steel-Strung Bow is on the pedestals.","52":"Byzantine caravans on the road. Stop a caravan with arrows: its loot is added to the treasury as coins.","100":"New campaign: Against the Crusaders! Crusader infantry and crossbowmen have arrived. 5 new levels in the Camp; the Sultan's Bow is on the pedestals.","103":"Knights take the field: the Crusaders' iron-clad riders. If your arrows aren't strong enough, avoid the clash.","105":"The Crusaders have built catapults. A stone falls where a red ring appears on the road: stay out of the ring.","150":"New campaign: Myriokephalon! Heavy shield infantry take the field. 5 new levels unlocked in the Camp.","153":"Mountain passes from here on. In a narrow gorge a big army gets squeezed and some are left behind. Enter the pass prepared.","200":"New campaign: Seljuk Zenith! Latin mercenaries take the field. 5 new levels unlocked in the Camp; the White-String Bow is on the pedestals.","250":"New campaign: Frontier Beyliks! Raiding west from Söğüt. Alan horsemen take the field; 5 new levels in the Camp.","300":"New campaign: Into Rumelia! Catalan mercenaries take the field. 5 new levels in the Camp; the Gazi Bow is on the pedestals.","303":"Ditches have been dug across the roads. Take your army over the bridge: raiders who don't fit on the bridge are left in the ditch.","350":"New campaign: Kosovo! Serbian infantry take the field. 5 new levels unlocked in the Camp.","353":"Serbian heavy cavalry take the field: the iron-clad riders of the Balkans.","400":"New campaign: Nicopolis! Hungarian horsemen and Crusader knights take the field. 5 new levels in the Camp; the Thunderbolt Bow is on the pedestals.","450":"New campaign: Varna! 5 new levels unlocked in the Camp.","453":"Wagon forts take the field: handgunners fire from behind chained wagons. Break the fort with arrows or go around the other side.","500":"New campaign: Conquest of Constantinople! Genoese men-at-arms take the field. 5 new levels unlocked in the Camp; the Conqueror's Bow is on the pedestals.","502":"City walls from here on: they block the whole road. Bring them down with arrows; if you can't, you crash and lose raiders.","510":"Venetian infantry take the field: soldiers of the sailors who came to defend the Golden Horn.","550":"New campaign: Campaigns of the Conqueror! Venetian infantry and Serbian horsemen take the field.","600":"New campaign: Belgrade and Rhodes! Croatian infantry and arquebusiers take the field; the Lawgiver's Bow is on the pedestals.","603":"Armoured Hungarian knights take the field: the heaviest cavalry yet. If your arrows aren't strong enough, avoid the clash.","630":"The Knights of Rhodes take the field: heavily armoured, slow and stubborn infantry.","650":"New campaign: Mohács! Hungarian light horsemen take the field.","652":"Cannons are firing! A cannonball rolls down the road where a red lane appears: get out of the lane.","655":"German mercenaries take the field: long pikes, many of them, and tough.","700":"New campaign: Buda! The final reckoning on the Danube.","750":"New campaign: Szigetvár! Habsburg cuirassiers and musketeers take the field.","800":"New campaign: Cyprus! Venice's stradiot horsemen take the field; the Köprülü Bow is on the pedestals.","850":"New campaign: Mezőkeresztes! The Habsburg and Transylvanian armies stand against you.","900":"New campaign: Crete! We march on Candia, Venice's strongest castle.","950":"New campaign: Uyvar and Kamaniçe! The Alp Arslan Bow is on the pedestals.","970":"The Polish campaign has begun: Cossack horsemen take the field.","973":"Winged hussars take the field: the heaviest riders of Poland.","1000":"New campaign: Prut! Russian infantry and Cossack riders take the field.","1005":"Russian grenadiers take the field: heavy, stubborn infantry.","1050":"Return to Manzikert! Every army you have faced over the centuries stands against you once more.","1071":"New campaign: The Morea! Venice's castles in the Morea await you.","1121":"New campaign: Belgrade! Austrian infantry take the field; the Mehter Bow is on the pedestals.","1171":"New campaign: Caransebeș! The Habsburg army is in the Banat.","1221":"New campaign: Acre! French infantry take the field: disciplined and tough.","1224":"French dragoons take the field: heavy and fast.","1271":"New campaign: Silistra! Sharpshooters take the field: they fire accurately from afar. The World Bow is on the pedestals.","1321":"New campaign: Plevna! Hold the redoubts, beat back the Russian assaults.","1371":"New campaign: Domokos! Greek infantry on the ridges of Thessaly.","1421":"Final campaign: Road to Conquest! Thirty-two steps to level one thousand four hundred and fifty-three."},"lane":{"300":"The road has widened: there are three lanes now. Gates offer three choices; look at all of them and pick the best.","700":"The road has widened to four lanes. Room for giant armies, but there are four choices at the gates."},"special":{"0":"Sultan Alp Arslan's raiders are on the march. Swipe your finger, go through the plus gates, break the blue blocks with arrows. Scatter the Byzantine outriders at the end.","1070":"Level one thousand and seventy-one. The plain where it all began: Manzikert. With the army you grew over the centuries, you face the Byzantine Imperial Army. Hold the banner high, Raider Bey.","1452":"Level one thousand four hundred and fifty-three. 29 May 1453, at dawn. The army you grew over the centuries stands before the walls of Istanbul. The breach is open, Raider Bey: the city awaits you."},"foes":{"piyade":"Byzantine Infantry","okcu":"Byzantine Archer","katafrakt":"Cataphract","varang":"Varangian Guard","akrit":"Akritai Rider","frank":"Crusader Infantry","arbalet":"Crossbowman","sovalye":"Knight","kalkanli":"Heavy Shield Infantry","latin":"Latin Mercenary","alan":"Alan Horseman","katalan":"Catalan Mercenary","sirppiyade":"Serbian Infantry","sirpsovalye":"Serbian Heavy Cavalry","macar":"Hungarian Horseman","tufekci":"Wagon Gunner","ceneviz":"Genoese Man-at-Arms","venedik":"Venetian Infantry","arkebuz":"Arquebusier","hirvat":"Croatian Infantry","zirhli":"Armoured Hungarian Knight","rodos":"Knight of Rhodes","husar":"Hungarian Light Horseman","landsknecht":"German Mercenary","kirasiyer":"Habsburg Cuirassier","muskeci":"Musketeer","stradiot":"Stradiot Horseman","kanatlihusar":"Winged Hussar","kazak":"Cossack Horseman","rusasker":"Russian Infantry","grenadiyer":"Russian Grenadier","avusturyapiyade":"Austrian Infantry","fransizpiyade":"French Infantry","fransizsuvari":"French Dragoon","nisanci":"Sharpshooter","yunanpiyade":"Greek Infantry"},"weapons":["Plain Bow","Kemankeş Bow","Double Bow","Fire Arrow","Sky Standard Bow","Steel-Strung Bow","Sultan's Bow","White-String Bow","Gazi Bow","Thunderbolt Bow","Conqueror's Bow","Lawgiver's Bow","Köprülü Bow","Alp Arslan Bow","Mehter Bow","World Bow"],"upg":{"start":["Raider Hearth","Set out with {n} raiders"],"dmg":["Arrowheads","Arrow power ×{n}"],"rate":["Archery School","Fire rate ×{n}"],"zirh":["Armourers' Guild","Clash losses −{n}%"]},"regions":[["Euphrates Banks","North from Aleppo",["Gate of Aleppo","Manbij Road","Euphrates Crossing","Plain of Urfa","Walls of Harran","Siverek Hills","Karacadağ","Before Diyarbakır","Silvan Road","Hasankeyf Bridge"],["Sultan Alp Arslan lifted the siege of Aleppo. The raiders were sent north, ahead of the Byzantine army.","The Euphrates runs muddy and the roads are long. Hold the banner high and keep the raiders together.","Scouts spotted Byzantine outriders ahead. Greet them with arrows first, then charge."]],["Azerbaijan Highlands","The army gathers at Khoy",["Khoy Camp","Salmas Pass","Shore of Urmia","Maku Gorge","Foot of Ararat","Diyadin Hot Springs","Doğubeyazıt Plateau","Patnos Flats","Slopes of Tendürek","Erciş Castle"],["Turkmen clans join from the highlands. Pick the right side at every gate and let the army grow.","The wind is fierce; keep the arrows true. Find good bows for your archers.","Byzantine archers line the hills. Let your arrows speak before you enter their range."]],["Shores of Lake Van","West from Ahlat",["Tombs of Ahlat","Port of Adilcevaz","Foot of Süphan","Tatvan Road","Nemrut Caldera","Gardens of Gevaş","Before Van Castle","Muradiye Falls","Lake Erçek","Plain of Çaldıran"],["Heavily armoured cataphracts were seen by the lake. Rain arrows on their horses; keep them at bay.","The stonemasons of Ahlat await our banner. Clear the road, Raider Bey.","The enemy has raised spiked barricades. Break them with arrows or go around."]],["Murat Valley","Last stops before Manzikert",["Bulanık Bridge","Hınıs Pass","Varto Ridges","Banks of the Murat","Plain of Muş","Karlıova","Tekman Plateau","Liz Forest","Zernak Hill","Çökek Spring"],["The emperor's Varangian Guard has come down into the valley. Their axes are heavy; be patient.","The Murat runs cold, but a raider's heart runs warm. Choose your gates wisely.","The Byzantine army has split. Break the column in front of you and open the way to the main host."]],["Plain of Manzikert","26 August 1071",["Manzikert Castle","Ahlat Road","Rahva Flats","Friday Prayer","Crescent Trap","Feigned Retreat","The Wings Close","Camp Tents","Varangian Line","The Emperor's Banner"],["The Sultan dressed in white: \"Today it is victory or martyrdom.\" The raiders form the crescent.","Feign a retreat, draw the enemy in, then close from the wings.","Dust and smoke over the plain. Keep the banner up; the gates of Anatolia will open here."]],["Cappadocia","West from Kayseri",["Plain of Kayseri","Foot of Erciyes","Vineyards of Talas","Ürgüp Valley","Fairy Chimneys of Göreme","Nevşehir Road","Mount Hasan","Aksaray Inn","Niğde Castle","Ihlara Canyon"],["After Manzikert, Anatolia lies open. Süleyman Shah leads the raiders west, through the fairy chimneys.","Akritai horsemen guard the Byzantine frontier. They come fast; meet them early with arrows.","The valleys of Cappadocia are narrow and winding. Don't rush the gates; pick the right side."]],["Konya Plain","Heart of the steppe",["Ereğli Springs","Karapınar Sands","Fields of Çumra","Çatalhöyük","Before Konya","Meram Vineyards","Sille Valley","Kadınhanı","Ilgın Baths","Lake Akşehir"],["Byzantine caravans roam the steppe. Stop a caravan with arrows and its loot goes to the treasury.","The plain is wide, the wind is cool. Konya will soon be a Turkish home.","The frontier duke has massed troops on the plain. Silence the archers first, then charge."]],["Phrygian Highlands","North from Afyon",["Bolvadin Bridge","Rock of Afyon","İhsaniye Plateau","Phrygian Valley","Midas Monument","Seyitgazi","Kütahya Road","Tavşanlı Pass","Domaniç Forest","İnegöl Plain"],["The old Phrygian rocks stand silent witness. The raiders fill the highlands with dust.","Cataphracts have reached the plateau. If you find the Fire Arrow, don't let it go.","North, towards the sea. Every gate may add a new warrior to your army."]],["Bithynian Forests","Crossing the Sakarya",["Bilecik Ridges","Söğüt Plateau","Osmaneli Bridge","Banks of the Sakarya","Geyve Gorge","Pamukova","Mekece Pass","Yenişehir Plain","Orhangazi Road","Gulf of Gemlik"],["The banks of the Sakarya are wooded. Beware of ambushes; Varangians lurk among the trees.","One day a great state will rise from these lands. Today the raiders clear the way.","The smell of the sea comes from Gemlik. Nicaea is very close."]],["Nicaea","1075 · Capital of Süleyman Shah",["Lake İznik","Lefke Gate","Yenişehir Gate","Lake Gate","Istanbul Gate","Before the Walls","Tower Raid","Aqueducts","Palace Road","Capital Nicaea"],["The walls of Nicaea rise by the lake. The gates will open one by one.","Süleyman Shah wants Nicaea as his capital. The raiders lead the way.","Byzantine archers on the walls. Strike first, then close in."]],["Marmara Coast","1096 · The Crusaders are coming",["Kibotos Shore","Civetot Camp","Drakon Creek","Halkalı Slope","Cape Hersek","Karamürsel Road","Crusader Vanguard","Plain of Nicaea","Back to the Walls","Night Sortie"],["Crusader armies have come from Europe. Sultan Kılıç Arslan sent his raiders to the coast.","The Crusader infantry is many but scattered. Come out of the gates big, then meet them with arrows.","Crossbow bolts hit hard. Thin their numbers before you enter their range."]],["Sakarya Valley","Kılıç Arslan falls back",["Lefke Gorge","Vezirhan","Sakarya Forest","Bozüyük Road","Karaköy Ridge","Sarıcakaya","Gölpazarı","Pazaryeri","Kovalıca Hill","Çukurhisar"],["The Crusaders have built catapults. A stone falls where its shadow appears: stay out of the ring.","Fall back and draw the enemy into the valley. Then rain arrows from the hills.","The knights wear iron. Find your strongest bow before you close in."]],["Dorylaeum","1 July 1097",["Plain of Eskişehir","Banks of the Porsuk","Bozdağ Ridges","Dawn Raid","Crusader Camp","Mounted Archers","Edge of the Marsh","Midday Heat","Second Crusader Column","Field of Dorylaeum"],["At dawn the Turkish horse archers surrounded the Crusader camp. Draw your bows; don't scatter.","The Crusader army is split in two. Break the one in front before the second column arrives.","The July heat wears down the armoured men. Be quick, Raider Bey."]],["Central Anatolia","Waterless roads",["Akşehir Plateau","Philomelion","Foot of Sultandağı","Ilgın Road","Wells Run Dry","Walls of Konya","Plain of Karaman","Taurus Road","Kızılırmak Crossing","Merzifon Flats"],["The Sultan dried up the wells and left the Crusaders thirsty. The roads are long, the armour heavy.","Catapult stones are falling again. Watch the shadow of the ring.","Chase the Crusaders retreating to the Taurus. Cut off the road."]],["Heraclea","1101 · The last Crusader wave",["Springs of Heraclea","Merzifon Plain","Lombard Column","Nevers Column","Headwaters","Ambush Valley","Dry Creek","Taurus Gate","Banner Hill","Victory at Heraclea"],["Summer of 1101: three Crusader armies entered Anatolia one after another. Meet them all.","Kılıç Arslan and Danishmend Gazi fight side by side. The raiders lead the way.","The final reckoning at the springs of Heraclea. Bring down the Crusader banner."]],["Defence of Konya","1176 · Byzantium returns",["Konya Castle","Alaeddin Hill","Meram Stream","Kızılören Inn","Beyşehir Road","Seydişehir","Kubadabad","Bozkır Plateau","Lake Suğla","Akkaya"],["Emperor Manuel marches on Konya with a great army. Sultan Kılıç Arslan II calls his raiders.","Heavy shield infantry are slow but solid. If your arrows aren't strong enough, go around them.","Konya is the Seljuk capital. Not one step back."]],["Lake District","From Eğirdir to Burdur",["Lake Eğirdir","Can Island","Ruins of Yalvaç","Gelendost","Mount Barla","Vineyards of Isparta","Ağlasun","Sagalassos Road","Lake Burdur","Keçiborlu"],["The Byzantine baggage train moves between the lakes, siege engines in tow.","The catapult master rains stones. Change your path before the shadows fall.","The lake water is clear; the army's road is hard."]],["Sultan Mountains","Mountain roads",["Sultandağı Summit","Çay Plain","Lake Bolvadin","Şuhut Plateau","Dinar Spring","Çivril Plain","Homa Pass","Source of the Meander","Lake Işıklı","Between the Mountains"],["The mountain roads narrow. In a tight pass a big army gets squeezed and some are left behind.","The Byzantine army has entered the mountains. Perfect time for an ambush.","West from the source of the Meander. The Varangians stay by the emperor's side."]],["Tzivritze Pass","The ambush is set",["Mouth of the Pass","Eagle Rocks","Narrow Gorge","Cloud of Dust","Byzantine Caravan","Baggage Wagons","Archers on the Slopes","Rolling Rocks","Mountain Wind","The Trap Closes"],["The Byzantine army entered the pass in a column miles long. The raiders wait on the heights.","The pass is narrow: mind the gorge while you grow your army.","The baggage wagons are full of loot. Stop the caravans and fill the treasury."]],["Myriokephalon","17 September 1176",["Myriokephalon Castle","Emperor's Tent","Siege Tower","Heavy Infantry Line","Banner Guards","Last Charge","Dust and Smoke","Envoys of Peace","Byzantium Breaks","Anatolia, a Turkish Home"],["The trap has closed. The Byzantine army is caught in the pass and the raiders descend from all sides.","The emperor's banner is on the hill. Scatter its guards.","After this victory Anatolia will never be taken back."]],["Antalya","1207 · Down to the Mediterranean",["Isparta Pass","Bucak Plateau","Döşemealtı","Düden Falls","Walls of Antalya","Kaleiçi","Hadrian's Gate","Konyaaltı Shore","Harbour Tower","Conquest of Antalya"],["Sultan Kaykhusraw descends to the Mediterranean. Latin mercenaries holding Antalya stand before the walls.","The road from the Taurus to the coast is long. Grow your army on the way and reach the walls strong.","If the harbour tower falls, the door to the Mediterranean opens."]],["Sinop","1214 · Opening to the Black Sea",["Kastamonu Road","Ilgaz Mountains","Boyabat Castle","Gerze Shore","Cape Sinop","Walls of Sinop","Pier Tower","Hamsilos Bay","Before the Dockyard","Conquest of Sinop"],["Sinop is the safest harbour on the Black Sea. The Duke of Trebizond's men have cut the road.","The forests of Ilgaz are cool and the roads narrow. Watch out for catapults.","A sultanate opening onto two seas is being born."]],["Alanya","1221 · Alaiye",["Manavgat Falls","Ruins of Side","Kalonoros Road","Alara Stream","Red Tower","Alanya Castle","Dockyard","Damlataş","Inner Castle","Alaiye"],["Sultan Alaeddin Kayqubad wants the castle on the steep rock. The gates of Kalonoros hold firm.","The coast road is narrow; a big army can get stuck among the rocks.","The Latin soldiers holding the Red Tower are stubborn. Keep the arrows flying."]],["Caravan Roads","From Sultanhanı to Kayseri",["Sultanhanı","Aksaray Road","Ağzıkarahan","Zazadin Inn","Obruk Inn","Kızılırmak Bridge","Sarıhan","Kayseri Road","Karatay Inn","The Caravan"],["Caravanserais keep the roads safe. Frontier riders turned bandits strike the caravans.","There are loot caravans along the road. Stop them with arrows and fill the treasury.","The Seljuk caravan road carries the trade of the world. Keep it open."]],["Sudak","1225 · The Crimean expedition",["Sinop Pier","Crossing the Black Sea","Port of Sudak","Crimean Shore","Kipchak Steppe","Rus Vanguard","Sudak Castle","Genoese Tower","Castle Gate","Victory at Sudak"],["The raiders crossed the Black Sea by ship to Crimea. Rus and Kipchak riders wait on the shore.","The steppe is wide and the horsemen fast. Meet them early with arrows.","If the port of Sudak falls, the Black Sea trade belongs to the Seljuks."]],["Söğüt","Homeland of Ertuğrul Gazi",["Söğüt Plateau","Domaniç Winter Camp","Camp of Ertuğrul","Karacahisar Road","Karacahisar","Bilecik Market","İnegöl Road","Kulaca Fort","Plain of Eskişehir","Frontier Banner"],["A small clan is growing at Söğüt. The lords' soldiers are blocking the frontier road.","Winter camp on the plateau, market on the plain. Each day the raiders push a little further west.","The lord's fort sits on the hill. Silence his archers first."]],["Sakarya Lands","West from the frontier",["Sakarya Crossing","Lefke Fort","Osmaneli","Geyve Gorge","Akhisar","Karatekin","Taraklı","Göynük","Mudurnu Road","Banks of the Sakarya"],["The forts along the Sakarya are falling one by one.","The gorges are narrow, the mountain roads steep. Don't get stuck in the pass.","The Byzantine border guards are falling back. Stay on their heels."]],["Bursa Plain","Foot of Uludağ",["Yenişehir","Yarhisar","Bilecik Fort","İnegöl","Lake Ulubat","Foot of Uludağ","Kestel","Hot Springs","Before Bursa","Çekirge"],["The plain of Bursa is lush green. The lords want to shield the city from siege.","The waters from Uludağ are cold; a raider's heart is warm.","If the forts around Bursa fall, the city stands alone."]],["Road to Nicaea","Marmara coasts",["Köprühisar","Lake İznik","Yalakova","Karamürsel","Hersek","Dil Pier","Yalova Shore","Armutlu","Gemlik","Lake Sapanca"],["The emperor has hired Alan horsemen. They come fast and hard.","The last Byzantine castles on the Marmara shore.","Set an ambush by the lake and draw the enemy in."]],["Bapheus","27 July 1302",["İzmit Road","Plain of Bapheus","Koyunhisar","Morning Ambush","Byzantine Regiment","Alan Wing","Heavy Infantry Line","Final Charge","Victory on the Plain","Banner of Osman Gazi"],["Byzantium sent a large army. Osman Gazi's raiders meet it at Bapheus.","The plain is wide and the enemy many. Come out of the gates big.","This victory will turn a small beylik into a state."]],["Bursa","1326 · A new capital",["Siege of Bursa","Balabancık Tower","Fort Gate","Pınarbaşı","Bath Gate","Bursa Surrenders","Bazaar Road","New Capital","Tophane Ridge","Victory at Bursa"],["The siege that lasted years is about to end. Orhan Gazi is at the gates of Bursa.","Ditches have been dug. Find the bridge and get your army across.","If Bursa falls, the beylik will have a capital."]],["Pelekanon","1329 · Against the emperor",["Eskihisar","Darıca","Pelekanon","Maltepe Ridges","Kartal Shore","Night Raid","The Emperor Withdraws","Gebze Road","Cape Dil","Victory at Pelekanon"],["The emperor marches with his army to save Nicaea. Catalan mercenaries are with him.","Rain arrows from the ridges; don't fight in the open plain.","The night raid scatters the Byzantine army. Stay on their heels."]],["Nicaea and Nicomedia","1331–1337",["Walls of Nicaea","Lake Gate","Nicaea Surrenders","Gulf of İzmit","Hereke","Karamürsel Dockyard","İzmit Castle","Kocaeli","Kandıra","Banner of Kocaeli"],["Nicaea becomes a Turkish city again. Nicomedia is next.","The first dockyard is built at Karamürsel. Hold the shore.","The ditched roads are hard. Don't miss the bridge."]],["Gallipoli","1354 · The Rumelian shore",["The Dardanelles","On the Rafts","Çimpe Castle","Bolayır","Gallipoli Peninsula","Night of the Earthquake","Walls of Gallipoli","Rumelian Shore","Tekirdağ Road","Conquest of Gallipoli"],["Süleyman Pasha took the raiders across the strait on rafts. Çimpe Castle is the first stop.","An earthquake brought down the walls; Gallipoli's gate stands open.","The first step on the Rumelian shore. There is no going back."]],["Adrianople","1361 · Heart of Rumelia",["Malkara","Keşan","Sazlıdere","İpsala","Banks of the Maritsa","Didymoteicho","Plain of Edirne","Tunca Bridge","Walls of Edirne","Conquest of Edirne"],["The plain of Thrace opens. The lord of Adrianople won't give up the castle.","The last Byzantine regiments on the banks of the Maritsa.","If Adrianople is taken, the heart of Rumelia is ours."]],["Thrace","1364 · The Serbian rout",["Philippopolis Road","Maritsa Valley","Chernomen","Serbian Rout","Haskovo","Old Zagora","New Zagora","Foot of the Balkans","Kazanlak","Banner of Thrace"],["A Balkan alliance marches on Adrianople. The raiders are ready for a night raid.","Serbian infantry are many. Come out of the gates big.","Let the Maritsa mist hide your army and guide your arrows."]],["Balkan Mountains","To Sofia",["Shipka Pass","Tarnovo Road","Balkan Forest","Karlovo","Plain of Sofia","Foot of Vitosha","Sofia Castle","Pirot","Niš Road","Niš Castle"],["The Balkan passes are narrow. A big army gets squeezed.","The Bulgarian boyars hold their castles. Open the road with arrows.","If the plain of Sofia opens, the Serbian lands are near."]],["Macedonia","From the Vardar to Ohrid",["Strumica","Vardar Valley","Veles","Skopje","Tetovo","Bitola","Prilep","Lake Ohrid","Štip","Banner of Macedonia"],["Castles line the Vardar valley. The Serbian voivodes resist.","The shores of Lake Ohrid are cool and the roads long.","Some roads have been ditched. Don't miss the bridge."]],["Serbian Lands","Along the Morava",["Ibar Valley","Kruševac Road","Banks of the Morava","Toplica","Prokuplje","Kuršumlija","Serbian Camp","Lab Creek","Banks of the Sitnica","Road to Kosovo"],["Serbian heavy cavalry are on the plain. Face the iron-clad riders with your strongest bow.","The Balkan army gathers on the banks of the Morava.","The road to Kosovo is opening."]],["Field of Kosovo","15 June 1389",["Field of Kosovo","Morning Array","Archers' Line","Heavy Cavalry Charge","Left Wing","Right Wing","Yıldırım's Charge","The Centre Collapses","The King's Banner","Victory at Kosovo"],["The Balkan alliance lined up on the Field of Kosovo. Sultan Murad sent the raiders forward.","Stop the heavy cavalry charge with arrows, then close from the wings.","The fate of the Balkans will be written on this field."]],["Danube Lands","From Vidin to Silistra",["Vidin Road","Danube Bank","Oryahovo","Lom Castle","Danube Islands","Silistra","Svishtov","Tarnovo","Danube Ships","Banner of the Danube"],["Bayezid the Thunderbolt makes the Danube the border. The river castles must be taken one by one.","The Danube is wide and fast. Beware of ambushes on the river road.","The Wallachian prince's horsemen come from the far bank."]],["Wallachia","1395 · Banks of the Argeș",["Karaova","Banks of the Argeș","Wallachian Forest","Rovine Marsh","Craiova","Olt River","Wallachian Camp","Turnu","Giurgiu","Return from Wallachia"],["The Wallachian forests are thick and the marshes deep. Don't get squeezed in the narrow pass.","Hungarian barons came to help the Wallachian prince.","At Rovine the mud is knee-deep. Be quick, Raider Bey."]],["The Crusader Host","1396 · Europe rises",["News from Buda","Iron Gate","Orșova","Crusader Vanguard","Siege of Vidin","Raid on Oryahovo","French Knights","Hungarian Horsemen","Staked Line","Before Nicopolis"],["Knights from all over Europe have come down to the Danube. Many and proud.","The French knights rush to charge. Let them come and greet them with arrows.","A knight who can't pass the staked line has to dismount."]],["Siege of Nicopolis","The castle holds",["Nicopolis Castle","Danube Gate","Siege Towers","Head of the Ditch","Foot of the Walls","Castle Guards","Yıldırım Arrives","Night March","Hilltop Camp","Morning Mist"],["The guards of Nicopolis will not surrender. The Crusaders have built siege towers.","Bayezid arrives like lightning. Break the siege.","Ditches have been dug. Find the bridge."]],["Field of Nicopolis","25 September 1396",["Staked Ranks","Raiders in Front","Knights' Charge","Up the Slope","The Sipahis Close","Hungarian Centre","Crusader Retreat","On the Danube Bank","Crusader Banner","Victory at Nicopolis"],["The knights charge uphill. Raiders in front, sipahis on the hilltop.","The stakes slow the knights. Keep the arrows coming.","If the Crusader banner falls, Europe's great army breaks."]],["Zlatitsa","1443 · Winter campaign",["Sofia Road","Zlatitsa Pass","Snowy Mountain","Zlatitsa Defile","Winter in the Mountains","Besieged Pass","Kunovica","Misty Valley","Philippopolis Road","Defence of Edirne"],["A Crusader army reached the Balkan passes in winter. Hold the defile.","The snow is knee-deep and the pass narrow. A big army gets squeezed.","The Transylvanian voivode's horsemen are forcing the pass."]],["The Peace Is Broken","1444 · The Crusade marches again",["Palace of Edirne","Envoys","Danube Bank","The Treaty","Crusaders on the March","Vidin Pass","Nicopolis Burns","Shumen","Provadia","Crusader Camp"],["The oath of peace was broken. The Crusader army crosses the Danube towards the Black Sea.","War wagons and handgunners take the field for the first time. There's gunpowder in the air.","They advance burning castles. Cut them off."]],["The Straits","The Sultan crosses",["Gallipoli Strait","Venetian Fleet","Anatolian Fortress","Genoese Ships","Crossing the Bosphorus","Rumelian Shore","Hayrabolu","Kırklareli","Aytos","Karnobat"],["The Venetian fleet has closed the strait. Sultan Murad takes his army across the Bosphorus.","Genoese ships are helping. Land on the shore and march fast.","The army is on the Rumelian shore. The hard march to Varna begins."]],["Black Sea Coast","To Varna",["Burgas","Sozopol","Aytos Pass","Cape Emine","Cape Galata","Lake Varna","Franga Plateau","Wagon Fort","Hungarian Horsemen","Before Varna"],["The Crusaders built a wagon fort at Varna. Guns fire from behind the wagons.","Break the wagon fort with arrows or go around it.","A narrow plain between the lake and the sea. The battle will be here."]],["Varna","10 November 1444",["Morning Array","Right Wing","Left Wing","Janissary Line","The King's Charge","Shield Wall","Wagon Castle","Crusader Retreat","Crusader Banner","Victory at Varna"],["The Crusader king charges the centre with his heavy cavalry. The Janissaries hold; the raiders ride on the wings.","The wings are wavering; keep the banner high.","After this victory, the road to Constantinople lies open."]],["Boğazkesen","1452 · Rumeli Hisarı",["Edirne Camp","Çorlu Road","Before Silivri","Bosphorus Shore","Foundations of the Fortress","Tower of Sarıca Pasha","Tower of Halil Pasha","Tower of Zağanos Pasha","The Strait-Cutter","The Fortress Stands"],["Sultan Mehmed II is building a fortress at the narrowest point of the Bosphorus. The raiders hold the shore.","A fortress that will rise in four months: protect the builders, keep the road open.","Genoese ships want to pass the strait. Rain arrows from the shore."]],["The Great Cannons","From Edirne to Constantinople",["Edirne Foundry","Cannon Carts","Çatalca Road","Büyükçekmece Bridge","Küçükçekmece","San Stefano","Camp Is Pitched","Lycus Ridges","Gun Emplacements","First Shot"],["The giant cannons set out from Edirne, pulled by hundreds of oxen. Clear the road ahead of them.","The camp is pitched before the city. Drive the Byzantine outriders back to the walls.","The first walls block the road. Bring them down with arrows or you will crash into them."]],["The Land Walls","April 1453",["Golden Gate","Yedikule","Gate of Selymbria","Gate of Rhegium","Gate of St Romanus","Gate of Charisius","Crooked Gate","Edge of the Moat","Lycus Valley","First Breach"],["Three layers of walls with a deep moat in front. For a thousand years no one got through.","The cannons pound the walls day and night. Let your arrows speak too.","Genoese men-at-arms hold the breach. Heavy, but slow."]],["The Golden Horn","Ships march over land",["Dolmabahçe Shore","Greasing the Slipways","Ships on the Hill","Kasımpaşa Creek","Shore of the Golden Horn","Before Galata","Behind the Chain","Ayvansaray","Fener Shore","The Golden Horn Is Ours"],["The mouth of the Golden Horn is closed by a chain. The Sultan moves his ships over the hills in one night.","When Byzantium wakes up, the ships are in the Golden Horn. Hold the shore.","Venetian and Genoese sailors shoot from behind the walls."]],["The Final Assault","29 May 1453",["Dawn","First Wave","Second Wave","Janissary Assault","Ulubatlı Hasan","Atop the Tower","Kerkoporta","The Walls Are Breached","Inside the City","The Conquest"],["The last morning of a fifty-three-day siege. The whole army charges at once.","Ulubatlı Hasan planted the banner on the tower. Follow him.","The breach is open. An age will pass through this gate."]],["Smederevo","1459 · On the Danube",["Danube Bank","Mouth of the Morava","Before Smederevo","The Despot's Palace","Golubac Road","Golubac Fortress","Kučevo","Braničevo","The Fortress Surrenders","Conquest of Smederevo"],["Smederevo on the Danube is the last fortress of the Serbian Despotate.","Serbian horsemen are back in the field. Meet the iron-clad with arrows.","If the fortress falls, the Danube is ours from end to end."]],["Morea","1460 · The Despotates",["Isthmus of Corinth","Hexamilion Wall","Corinth Castle","Arcadian Plateau","Tripolitsa Road","Mistra","Kalavryta","Patras","Navarino Shore","Conquest of the Morea"],["The despots of the Morea are at each other's throats. Venice holds the coastal castles.","Get past the wall that cuts the isthmus and enter the peninsula.","The mountains of Arcadia are steep. A big army gets squeezed in the pass."]],["Trebizond","1461 · East of the Black Sea",["Sinop Surrenders","Koyulhisar","Zigana Pass","Gümüşhane Road","Maçka Valley","Değirmendere","Walls of Trebizond","Castle Gate","Port of Trebizond","Conquest of Trebizond"],["The army descends to the Black Sea through the steep passes of Zigana. The rain never stops.","The mountain roads are narrow and slippery. Enter the pass prepared.","The walls of Trebizond reach down to the sea. Force the gate."]],["Bosnia","1463 · Beyond the mountains",["Sarajevo Plain","Bobovac Castle","Vranduk","Travnik","Jajce Road","Jajce Castle","Kreševo","Banks of the Neretva","Mountain Forts","Conquest of Bosnia"],["The king of Bosnia has withdrawn to his mountain castles. Hungarian barons are coming to help.","There are ambushes in the wooded valleys. Choose your gates wisely.","Jajce Castle sits on top of the cliff. Silence its archers first."]],["Negroponte and Otranto","1470–1480",["Negroponte Bridge","Walls of Negroponte","Venetian Castle","Aegean Shore","Port of Vlorë","Crossing the Adriatic","Otranto Shore","Walls of Otranto","Castle Bastion","Conquest of Otranto"],["Negroponte is Venice's greatest castle in the Aegean. A bridge has been built from ships.","Gedik Ahmed Pasha set sail from Vlorë. The Italian coast is next.","The walls of Otranto are high. Bring them down with arrows and open the breach."]],["Banks of the Sava","1521 · Road to Belgrade",["Sofia Camp","Niš Halt","Morava Bridge","Banks of the Sava","Šabac","Zemun","Kupinik","Slankamen","Crossing the Sava","Before Belgrade"],["Sultan Süleyman sets out on his first campaign. The target: Belgrade, the key to the Danube.","Croatian infantry guard the frontier. Come out of the gates big.","Arquebusiers fire from afar. Thin their numbers before entering their range."]],["Belgrade","August 1521",["Walls of Belgrade","Danube Tower","Water Gate","Outer Town","Castle Moat","Gun Emplacements","Nebojša Tower","Inner Castle","The Castle Surrenders","Conquest of Belgrade"],["We stand before Belgrade, untaken for seventy years. Layer upon layer of walls.","Cross the moats by the bridge and bring the walls down with arrows.","Armoured Hungarian knights sally out from the castle."]],["Aegean Road","1522 · The fleet sails",["Istanbul Dockyard","Port of Gallipoli","Dardanelles","Off Lesbos","Chios Shore","Before Bodrum","Marmaris Camp","Coastal Halt","Landing","Shore of Rhodes"],["The fleet and the army met at Marmaris. Rhodes lies across the water.","The knights on the shore want to stop the ships.","We have landed. Now, to the walls."]],["Walls of Rhodes","The siege begins",["English Bastion","Aragon Bastion","Italian Bastion","Sappers","Filling the Moat","Tower of St Nicholas","Harbour Tower","Bastion Breach","Winter Is Coming","The Walls Shake"],["The walls of Rhodes are the thickest in the Mediterranean. Each bastion is held by a different nation.","The sappers go under the walls. You rain arrows from above.","The Knights of Rhodes are heavily armoured and stubborn. Be patient."]],["Rhodes","December 1522",["Final Assault","Inside the Castle","Street of the Knights","Inner Harbour","Palace of the Grand Master","Surrender Talks","Harbour Gate","The Knights Depart","Banner on the Bastion","Conquest of Rhodes"],["The end of a six-month siege is near. The Grand Master of the Knights makes his last stand.","The winter wind is harsh, but the army stands tall.","If they surrender their lives will be spared. Take the last bastion first."]],["Along the Danube","1526 · North from Belgrade",["Belgrade Camp","Zemun Bridge","Slankamen","Danube Ships","Petrovaradin Road","Petrovaradin","Petrovaradin Fortress","Ilok","Vukovar","Plain of Syrmia"],["Sultan Süleyman marches north along the Danube. The raiders ride in front.","Hungarian light horsemen come fast. Meet them early with arrows.","The walls of Petrovaradin block the road. Open the breach."]],["Drava Bridge","Osijek",["Plain of Osijek","Banks of the Drava","Building the Bridge","Osijek Bridge","Crossing Over","Beyond the Bridge","Baranya","Darda","Marsh Road","Road to Mohács"],["A bridge was built over the Drava in five days. The army is crossing.","Whoever doesn't cross by the bridge is left in the ditch. Keep your army together.","The marsh roads are narrow. A big army can get squeezed."]],["Hungarian Camp","The king gathers his army",["Tolna","Paks Road","The King's Camp","Croatian Regiments","Mercenaries","Hungarian Guns","Wagons in Line","Edge of the Plain","Night Watch","Morning Array"],["The Hungarian king has gathered his army on the plain. German mercenaries are with him.","The Hungarian guns face the plain. Get off the red lane.","The wagon forts are up again. Break them or go around."]],["Plain of Mohács","Midday",["Edge of the Marsh","Down to the Plain","Right Wing","Left Wing","Hungarian Charge","Feigned Retreat","Cannon Fire","Janissary Line","The Wings Close","Into the Marsh"],["The Hungarian heavy cavalry charges the centre. The raiders fall back as if retreating and open to the wings.","The crescent of Manzikert is formed again at Mohács.","Cannons and muskets stopped the charge. Now close from the wings."]],["Mohács","29 August 1526",["The King's Guard","Armoured Cavalry","Final Charge","Hungarian Centre","The Mercenaries Scatter","The King Flees","The Plain Is Ours","Buda Road","Gate of Buda","Victory at Mohács"],["The battle didn't last two hours. The Hungarian army is breaking.","The king's guards make their last stand around the banner.","The road to Buda is open. But the reckoning on the Danube isn't over yet."]],["Road to Vienna","1529 · Raid into Austria",["Before Buda","Tata","Győr","Plain of Győr","Moson","Austrian Border","Raiders Ahead","Before Vienna","Winter Approaches","The Road Back"],["The raiders ride deep into Austria ahead of the army.","German mercenaries block the road with their long pikes.","Winter came early. The army returns to Buda; the raiders guard the rear."]],["Kőszeg","1532 · The German campaign",["Esztergom Road","Kőszeg Castle","Castle Bastion","Raid on Steyr","Graz Road","Banks of the Mura","Maribor","Along the Drava","Homeward Halt","Frontier Lands"],["The small castle of Kőszeg blocked the army's path. Bring its walls down with arrows.","Kasım Bey's raiders reach far up the Danube.","The way back through the mountains is hard. Watch the passes."]],["Slavonia","On the frontier",["Osijek Castle","Požega","Velika","Banks of the Drava","Koprivnica Road","Virovitica","Croatian Border","Along the Sava","Frontier Forts","Banner of Slavonia"],["Between the Drava and the Sava, the forts fall one by one.","The ban of Croatia's soldiers lay ambushes in the forests.","Ditched roads ahead again. Don't miss the bridge."]],["Pest","1541 · Across the Danube",["Plain of Pest","Austrian Camp","Danube Island","Walls of Pest","Night Raid","The Siege Is Broken","Austrian Retreat","Guns Left Behind","Danube Bridge","Before Pest"],["The Austrian army has besieged Buda. Sultan Süleyman rushes to relieve it.","A night raid broke the siege. Chase those who flee.","The Austrian guns were left on the plain, but they fire their last shots."]],["Buda","29 August 1541",["Buda Castle","Vienna Gate","Castle Hill","Royal Palace","Gellért Hill","Danube Bank","Thermal Baths","Castle Guards","Banner in the Castle","Province of Buda"],["The anniversary of Mohács. The army is at the gate of Buda.","The castle hill is steep and the walls thick. Open the breach with arrows.","If Buda is taken, Turkish banners will fly along the Danube for a century and a half."]],["Setting Out","1566 · From Istanbul to Belgrade",["Davutpaşa Camp","Edirne Halt","Philippopolis","Sofia","Niš","Belgrade Camp","Zemun Bridge","Crossing the Sava","Danube Bank","The Campaign Road"],["Seventy-two-year-old Sultan Süleyman sets out on his thirteenth campaign. The raiders ride in front again.","Habsburg cuirassiers are armoured from head to toe. If your arrows aren't strong enough, avoid the clash.","Musketeers fire from afar. Thin their numbers before entering their range."]],["Along the Drava","Siklós and Pécs",["Osijek Bridge","Banks of the Drava","Siklós Castle","Harsány Hill","Plain of Pécs","Pécs Bazaar","Memory of Mohács","Baranya Vineyards","Edge of the Marsh","Road to Szigetvár"],["The road along the Drava is long. The army passes the plain of Mohács, forty years on.","Passing through the bazaar of Pécs, the army nears the marshes. Watch the musketeers.","The marsh is near. Don't miss the bridge over the ditches."]],["Marshes of Szigetvár","A castle in the middle of the lake",["Almás Creek","Reed Marsh","New Town","Old Town","The Dam Breaks","The Water Recedes","Filling the Moat","Digging Mines","Gun Emplacements","Outer Castle"],["Szigetvár sits like an island in the marshes. When the dams break, the water recedes.","The new town has fallen; the old town is next.","You can't reach the walls without filling the ditches. Find the bridge."]],["Walls of Szigetvár","August 1566",["Before the Inner Castle","Bastion Breach","Castle Gate","Croatian Guards","Powder Tower","Night Assault","Rain of Fire","The Walls Burn","Last Bastion","The Siege Goes On"],["The Croatian commander has withdrawn to the inner castle. Muskets crack from the walls.","The night assault has begun. Find your way by torchlight.","Bring the walls down with arrows and open the breach."]],["Szigetvár","7 September 1566",["The Last Night","The Sultan's Tent","A Silent Camp","Morning Assault","The Commander Rides Out","Last Sortie","The Inner Castle Falls","The Powder Blows","Banner on the Bastion","Conquest of Szigetvár"],["The camp is silent. No word from the Sultan's tent, but the order to attack has been given.","The castle commander makes his last sortie. Keep the arrows flying.","When Szigetvár falls the army will mourn, but victory comes first."]],["The Fleet Sails","1570 · The Mediterranean",["Golden Horn Dockyard","The Dardanelles","Aegean Islands","Port of Rhodes","Off Finike","Cyprus on the Horizon","Larnaca Shore","Landing","Larnaca Salt Lake","Camp Is Pitched"],["The fleet and the army sail together for Cyprus. The landing will be at Larnaca.","Venice's stradiot horsemen watch the shore. They come fast.","We have landed. Scatter the outriders before setting up camp."]],["Nicosia","September 1570",["Plain of Nicosia","The New Walls","Eleven Bastions","Podocataro Bastion","Edge of the Moat","Cannon Fire","Bastion Breach","City Gate","Inside the Castle","Conquest of Nicosia"],["The brand-new walls of Nicosia are ringed by eleven bastions.","Venetian musketeers on the bastions. Thin them before entering their range.","The breach is open. The road into the city passes through this gate."]],["Kyrenia and the Five Finger Mountains","The north coast",["Five Finger Mountains","Mountain Pass","Kyrenia Castle","Before the Harbour","Coast Road","Mesaoria Plain","Village Roads","Spring Head","Plain Halt","Road to Famagusta"],["When Nicosia fell, Kyrenia opened its gates without a fight. The army turns east.","The passes of the Five Finger Mountains are narrow. A big army gets squeezed.","The Mesaoria plain is hot and dusty. Famagusta is on the horizon."]],["Siege of Famagusta","Winter 1570–1571",["Walls of Famagusta","Arsenal Bastion","Land Gate","Martinengo Bastion","Mines","Filling the Moat","Gun Batteries","Winter Passes","Spring Assault","The Breach Opens"],["The walls of Famagusta are the strongest on the island. The siege has dragged into winter.","The sappers go under the walls. Rain arrows from above.","Spring has come and the cannons won't stop. The breach widens every day."]],["Famagusta","1 August 1571",["Final Assault","Ravelin","Sea Gate","Castle Guards","Venetian Banner","Out of Powder","Surrender Talks","The Gate Opens","The Harbour Is Ours","Conquest of Cyprus"],["The castle has run out of powder and bread. The last stand begins.","The Venetian banner flies on the bastion. It's up to you to bring it down.","If Famagusta falls, the whole island is ours."]],["North from Belgrade","1596",["Belgrade Camp","Danube Bridge","Petrovaradin","Szeged Road","Banks of the Tisza","Szolnok","Hungarian Plain","Frontier Forts","Raider Vanguard","Road to Eger"],["Sultan Mehmed III leads his army himself. The target: Eger Castle.","The Transylvanian prince's horsemen block the road. Meet them early with arrows.","The banks of the Tisza are flat and wide. Don't rush the gates."]],["Eger","October 1596",["Eger Castle","Before the Bastion","Gun Emplacements","Castle Moat","Castle Gate","Inner Castle","Eger Surrenders","Bükk Mountains","Forest Road","Edge of Mezőkeresztes"],["Eger Castle, untaken forty-four years ago, will fall this time.","Bring down the walls and cross the moat by the bridge.","Eger has fallen, but the Habsburg army is coming to the rescue."]],["Marshes of Mezőkeresztes","The Habsburg army approaches",["Marsh Road","Reed Bank","Bridgehead","Habsburg Vanguard","Musket Line","Gun Carts","Left Wing","Right Wing","In the Fog","The Army Forms Up"],["The Habsburg and Transylvanian armies have lined up on the far side of the marsh.","Fog covers the plain. Watch the gates.","Cannons and muskets are firing. Get off the cannonball lanes."]],["The First Day","24–25 October 1596",["Morning Skirmish","Marsh Crossing","Line of Fire","Falling Back","Habsburg Camp","Loot Wagons","The Army Seems Lost","Cooks and Grooms","Counterattack","Waiting for Night"],["The enemy entered the camp and, thinking the battle won, started looting.","Cooks and grooms defend the camp with the axes in their hands.","Time to counterattack. Stop the loot wagons with arrows."]],["Mezőkeresztes","26 October 1596",["The Last Day","The Sultan's Banner","Cığalazade's Charge","The Wings Close","Driven into the Marsh","The Cuirassiers Scatter","Habsburg Centre","Guns Abandoned","The Plain Is Ours","Victory at Mezőkeresztes"],["Cığalazade Sinan Pasha's horsemen burst out behind the enemy.","The Habsburg army is being driven into the marsh. Close the wings.","If the cuirassiers scatter, the plain is ours."]],["Chania","1645",["The Fleet Sets Out","Crossing the Aegean","Crete on the Horizon","Landing","Walls of Chania","Harbour Tower","Conquest of Chania","Rethymno Road","Rethymno Castle","Along the Coast"],["The fleet has landed on Crete. The first target is Chania.","Venice has held Crete for four hundred years. Its coastal castles are strong.","Chania has been taken. Rethymno is next."]],["Cretan Mountains","Foot of Mount Ida",["Mount Ida","Olive Groves","Mountain Villages","Valley Road","Venetian Vanguard","Rocky Pass","Spring Head","Plain Halt","Plain of Candia","Before Candia"],["Olive groves on the slopes of Mount Ida. The roads are narrow and rocky.","Stradiot horsemen lay ambushes on the mountain roads.","The walls of Candia rise at the far end of the plain."]],["Walls of Candia","A siege of many years",["Martinengo Bastion","Pantokrator Bastion","Sabionera Bastion","Edge of the Moat","Sappers","Countermine","Artillery Duel","Winter Trenches","Venetian Relief","The Walls Shake"],["The bastions of Candia cover one another. The siege has lasted for years.","The sappers fight underground. Stand firm above.","Bring the walls down with arrows and get off the cannonball lanes."]],["Help from Europe","1669 · French ships",["French Landing","Night Raid","Powder Store","The Landing Scatters","The Ships Withdraw","Harbour Blockade","The Last Relief","Venice Stands Alone","Foot of the Walls","Surrender Is Near"],["French ships have brought help. They landed at night.","When the powder store blew up, the landing scattered. Stay on their heels.","Venice is alone now. Close in on the walls."]],["Candia","6 September 1669",["Final Assault","Sabionera Breach","Inner Moat","Castle Gate","Surrender Talks","Venice Withdraws","Harbour Gate","Into the City","Banner on the Bastion","Conquest of Crete"],["The last days of a twenty-four-year siege. Grand Vizier Köprülüzade Fazıl Ahmed Pasha stands before the walls.","The commander of Candia agrees to talk surrender. Take the last bastion first.","If Crete falls, Venice's last great castle in the Aegean is ours too."]],["Road to Uyvar","1663 · Köprülüzade Fazıl Ahmed Pasha",["Buda Camp","Esztergom","Danube Bridge","Párkány","Plain of Nitra","Banks of the Váh","Habsburg Vanguard","Marsh Road","Before Uyvar","Camp Is Pitched"],["The Grand Vizier marches his army north of the Danube, to Uyvar.","The Nitra plain is wide. Four gates to choose from; find the best.","The Habsburg vanguard has set an ambush in the marsh."]],["Uyvar","September 1663",["Uyvar Fortress","Six Bastions","Castle Moat","Gun Batteries","Mines","The Breach","Castle Guards","Call to Surrender","Castle Gate","Conquest of Uyvar"],["Uyvar is a star-shaped fortress with six bastions. Each bastion covers the others.","The cannons pound the walls. Widen the breach with arrows.","If Uyvar falls, the road to Vienna opens again."]],["Podolia","1672 · The Polish campaign",["Crossing the Danube","Isaccea Bridge","Banks of the Dniester","Khotyn Fortress","Podolian Plain","Wheat Fields","Cossack Vanguard","Polish Horsemen","Ladyzhyn","Road to Kamaniçe"],["Sultan Mehmed IV is on the Polish campaign. Cossack riders ride beside the army.","The wheat fields of Podolia stretch endlessly. The plain is wide, the road long.","The winged Polish hussars are heavy and fast. Ready your strongest bow."]],["Siege of Kamaniçe","August 1672",["Smotrych Valley","Rocky Headland","New Castle","Old Castle","Bridgehead","Mines","Cannon Fire","Castle Tower","Polish Guards","The Breach Opens"],["Kamaniçe sits on a rocky headland in the bend of a deep valley.","The only way in is over the bridge. Don't miss it.","The mines went off; the breach is open."]],["Kamaniçe","27 August 1672",["Final Assault","Winged Hussars","Castle Gate","Castle Guards","Powder Tower","Surrender","Banner on the Bastion","Buchach Road","Treaty of Buchach","Conquest of Kamaniçe"],["The Polish guards hold the castle's last gate. Charge!","Meet the last charge of the winged hussars with arrows.","When Kamaniçe falls, Podolia is ours."]],["North from the Danube","1711",["Edirne Camp","Babadag","Isaccea","Danube Bridge","Cartal","Moldavia Road","Iași Road","Tatar Riders","The Steppe","Banks of the Prut"],["The Russian Tsar has entered Moldavia with his army. Baltacı Mehmed Pasha marches to meet him.","The riders of the Crimean Tatars lead the army.","The steppe is wide and the Russian infantry many. Come out of the gates big."]],["Moldavia","The Russian army at Iași",["Iași","Moldavian Forest","Cossack Vanguard","Russian Vanguard","Village Roads","Prut Valley","Fălciu","Edge of the Marsh","Building the Bridge","Crossing the Prut"],["The Russian army is at Iași. Cossack riders emerge from the forests.","A bridge has been built over the Prut. The army is crossing.","The road along the marsh is narrow. Find the bridge over the ditches."]],["Banks of the Prut","July 1711",["Stănilești","Russian Camp","Wagons in Line","Musket Line","Grenadier Assault","Janissary Line","Gun Batteries","The Ring Closes","Water Cut Off","The Russians Are Trapped"],["The Russian army has built a wagon fort in the bend of the river.","The grenadiers hit hard. Meet them early with arrows.","The water route has been cut. The ring is closing."]],["The Encirclement","Three days and three nights",["Night Fire","Russian Sortie","Counterattack","Tatar Cavalry","Riverbank","Powder Runs Low","Second Night","Last Sortie","An Envoy Comes","The Peace Tent"],["The Russian army tries to break out day and night. Hold the line.","The Tsar's guards want to break the encirclement.","A peace envoy is coming. But first, beat back the last sortie."]],["Prut","22 July 1711",["Morning of the Treaty","Russian Guards","The Tsar's Banner","Last Line","The Army Withdraws","Azov Retaken","The Way Home","Danube Bank","Victory Parade","Victory on the Prut"],["The Tsar asked for peace. Azov will be handed back.","The Russian guards withdraw with their banners. Scatter the last line.","The victory parade heads back to the Danube."]],["The Raiders' Road","Memories of the centuries",["Söğüt","Bursa","Edirne","Kosovo","Istanbul","Mohács","Rhodes","Szigetvár","Candia","Prut"],["The road opened over the centuries lies before you once more. Every halt holds the memory of an old victory.","Every army is back to face you: from Byzantium to Russia, from Crusaders to Habsburgs.","The banner turns east, to the plain where it all began."]],["Return to the East","From the Euphrates to Van",["Gate of Aleppo","Euphrates Crossing","Plain of Urfa","Before Diyarbakır","Tombs of Ahlat","Before Van Castle","Foot of Süphan","Banks of the Murat","Plain of Muş","Manzikert Castle"],["The Euphrates runs muddy again and the roads are long. But now a great army rides behind you.","The tombs of Ahlat, the castle of Van: everything as it was on the first day.","Manzikert Castle is on the horizon. The plain awaits you."]],["Plain of Manzikert","26 August 1071",["Manzikert"],["The Sultan dressed in white. Level one thousand and seventy-one: it all began on this plain, and here it will be completed."]],["Corinth","1715 · The Isthmus",["Athens Road","Megara","Before the Isthmus","Corinth Castle","Acrocorinth","The Castle Surrenders","Argos Road","Plain of Argolis","Before Nauplia","Camp"],["Grand Vizier Damat Ali Pasha marches to take the Morea back from Venice.","Acrocorinth sits atop the cliff. Silence its archers first.","The isthmus is crossed; the gate of the peninsula is open."]],["Nauplia","Venice's castle in the Morea",["Port of Nauplia","Palamidi Hill","Bastion Road","Before the Walls","Mines","Assault on Palamidi","Castle Gate","Harbour Tower","Into the City","Conquest of Nauplia"],["The bastions of Palamidi are newly built, and Venice trusts them deeply.","Bring the walls down with arrows and open the breach.","If Nauplia falls, the capital of the Morea is ours."]],["Mountains of the Morea","South from Arcadia",["Tripolitsa","Arcadian Plateau","Megalopolis","Mountain Villages","Rocky Pass","Olive Valley","Kalamata","Plain of Messenia","Coast Road","Before Koroni"],["The mountain roads of Arcadia are narrow. A big army gets squeezed in the pass.","Stradiot horsemen lay ambushes in the valleys.","Koroni and Methoni wait in the south."]],["Koroni and Methoni","The southern castles",["Koroni Castle","Harbour Bastion","Methoni Road","Methoni Castle","Sea Gate","Port of Navarino","Navarino Castle","Coastal Forts","Venetian Ships","The South Is Ours"],["The coastal castles get support from the sea. Get over the walls before the ships arrive.","Get off the cannonball lanes; the coastal guns are firing.","The southern castles fall one by one."]],["Morea","September 1715",["Monemvasia Road","Rocky Island","Castle Bridge","Monemvasia","Last Venetian Castle","Surrender Talks","Morean Shore","Victory Parade","Banner on the Bastion","Conquest of the Morea"],["Monemvasia is a rock rising from the sea. The only way in is over the bridge.","Venice's last castle is about to surrender.","The Morea is ours again, in a hundred days."]],["Niš Road","1737 · The Habsburg march",["Sofia Camp","Pirot","Before Niš","Niš Castle","Morava Valley","Paraćin","Jagodina","Wooded Hills","Smederevo Road","Near the Danube"],["The Habsburg army has taken Niš. The army sets out from Sofia to meet it.","The white-coated Austrian infantry are orderly and patient.","North along the Morava valley. The Danube is near."]],["Grocka","22 July 1739",["Grocka Ridges","Among the Vineyards","Narrow Road","Habsburg Vanguard","Cuirassier Charge","Hilltop Position","Morning Battle","Midday Heat","Habsburg Retreat","Victory at Grocka"],["The Habsburg army is coming along the narrow road between the vineyards. Hold the ridges.","The cuirassiers are stuck on the narrow road. Keep the arrows flying.","Win at Grocka and the road to Belgrade opens."]],["Before Belgrade","The siege",["Danube Bank","Sava Bridge","Zemun","Walls of Belgrade","Gun Batteries","Castle Moat","Mines","Castle Gate","Outer Town","The Ring Closes"],["Belgrade has been in Habsburg hands for twenty-one years. The walls are surrounded again.","Cross the moats by the bridge and bring the walls down with arrows.","The ring is closing. Watch for sorties from the castle."]],["Danube Islands","Ada Kaleh and Orșova",["Iron Gate","Orșova","Ada Kaleh","Danube Ships","Mehadia Road","River Fort","Island Siege","The Castle Surrenders","Along the River","Back to Belgrade"],["Ada Kaleh in the middle of the Danube holds the river.","The Iron Gate gorge is narrow and rocky.","When the islands fall, Belgrade stands alone."]],["Belgrade","18 September 1739",["The Final Siege","Inner Castle","Nebojša Tower","Castle Guards","The Treaty Tent","The Castle Surrenders","Castle Gate","Into the City","Banner on the Bastion","Belgrade Is Ours Again"],["The treaty tent has been pitched, but the castle guards are still on the bastions.","Break the last stand and let the gates of Belgrade open.","The key to the Danube is ours again."]],["North from Vidin","1788",["Vidin Camp","Danube Bridge","Kladovo Fortress","Iron Gate Gorge","Orșova Shore","Kladovo","Mountain Roads","Habsburg Vanguard","Border Post","Banat Road"],["The Habsburgs and Russia have declared war together. The Grand Vizier takes his army north of the Danube.","Clear the border posts one by one.","The road to the Banat runs through the mountains."]],["Mehadia","Mountain passes",["Mehadia Castle","Hot Springs","Cerna Valley","Narrow Gorge","Artillery Position","Forest Road","Rocky Ridge","The Pass Is Held","The Habsburgs Withdraw","Victory at Mehadia"],["The Cerna valley is narrow and wooded. Enter the pass prepared.","Habsburg guns hold the valley. Get off the cannonball lanes.","If Mehadia falls, the Banat plain opens up."]],["Banat Plain","The plain widens",["Lugoj Road","Banat Villages","Cornfields","Banks of the Timiș","Plain Halt","Cavalry Clash","Raider Vanguard","Night March","Edge of the Marsh","Road to Caransebeș"],["The Banat plain is covered with cornfields. The horsemen come fast.","The Habsburg army is falling back to Caransebeș. Stay on their heels.","The night march has begun. Find your way by torchlight."]],["Night at Caransebeș","21 September 1788",["Night Camp","Bridgehead","A Cry in the Dark","Panic","Firing on Their Own","The Army Falls Apart","Wagons Overturned","Fleeing Horsemen","Morning Mist","An Empty Plain"],["In the dark of night a cry rose in the Habsburg army: \"The Turks are coming!\"","Panic spreads from rank to rank; units open fire on one another.","By morning the plain is empty. Chase those who fled."]],["Caransebeș","September 1788",["Caransebeș Town","Habsburg Rearguard","Last Line","The Emperor Withdraws","Loot Wagons","The Banat Is Ours","Castle Gate","Victory Parade","Banner on the Bastion","Victory at Caransebeș"],["The emperor is withdrawing with what is left of his army. Scatter the rearguard.","Stop the loot wagons with arrows and fill the treasury.","The Banat plain belongs to the Turkish riders once again."]],["Gaza Road","1799 · The French are coming",["El-Arish","Sands of Sinai","Gaza","Khan Yunis","Coast Road","Before Jaffa","Ramla","Walls of Jaffa","Orange Groves","March North"],["Napoleon has left Egypt and marches up the Syrian coast. Acre stands in his way.","The French infantry are disciplined and tough. Come out of the gates big.","The sandy coast road is hot. Be quick, Raider Bey."]],["Carmel","Haifa and Mount Carmel",["Port of Haifa","Mount Carmel","Mountain Slope","Kishon Valley","Coastal Pass","French Vanguard","Tabor Road","Galilean Hills","Edge of the Plain","Acre on the Horizon"],["Mount Carmel runs down to the sea. The coastal pass is narrow.","The French dragoons are on the plain. Meet them early with arrows.","The walls of Acre stand at the far end of the bay."]],["Walls of Acre","March 1799",["The Land Walls","The Accursed Tower","Castle Moat","French Trenches","Mine","Countermine","British Ships","Guns from the Sea","The Breach","The First Assault Repelled"],["Cezzar Ahmed Pasha repaired the walls and deepened the moats.","Ships from the sea carry cannons to the walls.","A breach was opened, but the first assault was beaten back."]],["The Siege","April–May 1799",["Night Sortie","Battle in the Moat","French Guns","The Siege Drags On","A New Breach","Battle for the Bastion","Help from Rhodes","Landing on the Shore","At the Foot of the Walls","The Last Assault Is Coming"],["The siege has passed two months. The French guns are silent neither day nor night.","Relief ships have arrived from Rhodes. Cover the landing.","The last great assault is near. Stand firm in the breach."]],["Acre","20 May 1799",["The Last Assault","Battle in the Breach","French Guards","Before the Tower","French Retreat","Guns Left Behind","Coast Road","On Their Heels","Victory on the Walls","Defence of Acre"],["The French guards throw themselves at the breach. This is the last assault.","Napoleon lifts the siege, leaving his guns behind.","On the walls of Acre, a dream of empire came to an end."]],["Kalafat","1853 · The far bank of the Danube",["Vidin","Kalafat Camp","Danube Bank","Cetate Village","Russian Vanguard","Under the Snow","Raid on Cetate","Russian Retreat","Wallachian Plain","Victory at Kalafat"],["The middle of winter. The army has dug in at Kalafat, on the far bank of the Danube.","A Russian column is snowed in at Cetate. Time for a raid.","Sharpshooters fire accurately from afar. Thin them before entering their range."]],["The Danube Line","From Ruse to Silistra",["Ruse","Tutrakan","River Redoubts","Danube Islands","Russian Ships","Coast Road","Near Silistra","Building the Redoubts","Night Watch","The Russians Cross"],["The Russian army has crossed the Danube and is marching on Silistra.","The river redoubts are earth and timber. Fortify them fast.","Keep your eyes open on the night watch."]],["Arab Tabia","May 1854",["Arab Tabia","Earthen Rampart","Redoubt Ditch","Russian Mine","Night Assault","Defending the Redoubt","Cannon Fire","Sharpshooters","Counterattack","The Redoubt Stands"],["A small earthen redoubt blocks the Russian army.","Russian sappers dig under the redoubt. Rain arrows from above.","The night assault was beaten back. The redoubt still stands."]],["Siege of Silistra","Forty days",["Walls of Silistra","Line of Redoubts","Russian Batteries","Bombardment","Sortie","Bread Runs Low","Castle Tower","Help Is on the Way","The Last Mine","The Siege Drags On"],["Russian batteries have been pounding the town for days.","Silence the batteries with a sortie.","Help is on the way. Hold on a little longer."]],["Silistra","June 1854",["The Last Assault","Before the Redoubt","Russian Guards","The Siege Is Lifted","Russian Retreat","Danube Bank","A Fleeing Army","Silistra Is Saved","Banner on the Bastion","Victory at Silistra"],["The Russian marshal has ordered the last assault. Hold the redoubts!","The siege is lifted. The Russian army falls back to the Danube.","Silistra is saved."]],["From Vidin to Plevna","July 1877",["Vidin Camp","Forced March","Banks of the Lom","Vit Valley","Plain of Plevna","Digging the Redoubts","Night Work","Grivitsa Hill","Russian Vanguard","First Plevna"],["Gazi Osman Pasha rushed his army from Vidin to Plevna.","Earthen redoubts are being dug on the hills. Work day and night.","The Russian vanguard has arrived. Meet the first assault."]],["The Redoubts","Earthen walls",["Grivitsa Redoubt","The Bloody Redoubt","Green Hills","Earthen Trenches","Sharpshooters' Line","Russian Battery","Night Raid","Between the Redoubts","Second Plevna","The Trenches Hold"],["The redoubts cover one another. Sharpshooters fire from the trenches.","Russian batteries pound the hills. Get off the cannonball lanes.","The second great assault was beaten back too."]],["Lovech","September 1877",["Lovech Road","Lovech Town","Russian Corps","Mountain Ridge","Fighting in the Town","Falling Back","Keep the Road Open","Supply Wagons","Back to Plevna","Line of Redoubts"],["Lovech holds Plevna's supply road. A Russian corps has fallen upon the town.","Protect the supply wagons. The road must stay open.","Back to Plevna. The great assault is near."]],["Third Plevna","11 September 1877",["Morning Fog","Russian Batteries","Assault on Grivitsa","Left Flank","Assault on the Green Hills","Hand to Hand in the Redoubt","Counterattack","The Trenches Retaken","Nightfall","Third Plevna"],["After four days of bombardment, the greatest assault began.","Hand-to-hand fighting in the redoubts. Take the trenches back.","In the dark of evening, the assault broke."]],["Plevna","A legend",["The Ring Tightens","Winter Comes","Supplies Run Low","Vit Bridge","The Last Sortie","The Breakout","Russian Line","Gazi's Banner","The Redoubts Stand","The Legend of Plevna"],["Winter has come and supplies are running low. Gazi Osman Pasha prepares the last sortie.","Charge the Russian line across the Vit bridge.","The legend of Plevna is on everyone's lips."]],["Elassona","April 1897",["Elassona Camp","Border Posts","Foot of Olympus","Meluna Pass","Mountain Ridges","Night March","Battle for the Pass","In the Fog","The Pass Is Held","Plain of Thessaly"],["Edhem Pasha gathered his army at Elassona. Mountain passes lie ahead.","The Meluna pass is narrow and foggy. A big army gets squeezed.","The pass is held; the plain of Thessaly lies at your feet."]],["Tyrnavos","Down into Thessaly",["Tyrnavos","Plain Villages","Riverbank","Cavalry Vanguard","Larissa Road","Larissa","Into the City","Plain of Thessaly","Wheat Fields","Pharsala Road"],["The army has come down to the plain. Larissa was abandoned without a fight.","By the river, cross the ditches by the bridge.","On the road to Pharsala, the enemy forms up again."]],["Velestino","The mountain road",["Velestino Pass","Railway Line","Hilltop Positions","Sharpshooters","Narrow Road","Cavalry Charge","Battle for the Pass","Rocky Ridge","Velestino","Volos Road"],["The Velestino pass leads down to the port of Volos. The hills are full of sharpshooters.","A cavalry charge on the narrow road: meet it early with arrows.","Open the pass and the road to Volos opens too."]],["Pharsala","May 1897",["Plain of Pharsala","Hill Line","Gun Batteries","Left Flank","Right Flank","Evening Assault","Night Retreat","Domokos Road","Foot of the Mountain","Before Domokos"],["An enemy line has formed on the hills of Pharsala.","The evening assault broke the line; the enemy withdraws in the night.","The last position: the ridges of Domokos."]],["Domokos","17 May 1897",["Ridges of Domokos","Trenches","Sharpshooters' Line","Morning Artillery","Midday Assault","Up the Ridge","The Trenches Fall","Evening Victory","Ceasefire","Victory at Domokos"],["The ridges of Domokos are covered with trenches. The uphill assault is hard.","The trenches fall one by one. Keep the banner high.","By evening the ridges were taken. The war is ending."]],["Banner of the Centuries","From the Morea to Domokos",["Corinth","Grocka","Mehadia","Caransebeș","Acre","Silistra","Arab Tabia","Plevna","Velestino","Domokos"],["The victories of the last two centuries lie before you once more.","From Venice to France, from the Habsburgs to Russia: every army stands against you again.","The banner returns to Istanbul, the city where everything changed."]],["The Bosphorus","From Rumeli Hisarı to the walls",["Edirne Camp","Çorlu","Silivri","The Strait-Cutter","Rumeli Hisarı","The Great Cannons","Camp Is Pitched","Ships over Land","The Golden Horn","Before the Walls"],["Rumeli Hisarı rises again at the narrowest point of the Bosphorus.","The great cannons are on the road. Clear the way ahead of them.","The ships come down over the hills into the Golden Horn."]],["Walls of Constantinople","29 May 1453",["Golden Gate","Yedikule","Gate of St Romanus","Gate of Charisius","Lycus Valley","The Land Moat","The Breach","Ulubatlı Hasan","Banner on the Tower","Kerkoporta","Inside the City","The Conquest"],["Three layers of walls with a deep moat in front. The last days of a fifty-three-day siege.","Ulubatlı Hasan planted the banner on the tower. Follow him.","The breach is open. An age will pass through this gate."]]]};
